{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres (Game of the Year) board game award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/e28b3f486006a6edf3265cb1002eabd4.poster.avif?t=1755616281\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/e28b3f486006a6edf3265cb1002eabd4.webm?t=1755616281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/94fb3f4b04e4f1132b8547fc681f56d1.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the genuine Kingdomino board game by Bruno Cathala and Blue Orange with all original rules and artwork from Cyril Bouquet and Pauline D\u00e9traz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/873d561d7b61a1b9f410c11865c76030.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge AI opponents, join online multiplayer matches, or play online with friends. Take on the illustrious 7x7 Mighty Duel challenge, or stack up your score with over 15 unique quests to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/07b60893751d148b51127720daf403ab.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span>Uncover and explore uncharted lands. Earn unique rewards by gathering domino pieces and crafting them into Magic Dominoes in the single-player Lost Kingdom mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/a44c1b1f9b4bf1c0781c68b3ca1e7140.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together as a community by competing in Live Events and Challenges! Complete special daily quests to gain points. If the community earns enough points by the time the event ends, exclusive rewards can be won!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/13409a26899d4268ecfa2ef44451b543.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-crafted visuals with dynamic animations bring your kingdom to life. Play the game based on the new Kingdomino 2025 visuals by Pauline D\u00e9traz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/0a8a55fa04a5ce7cd5d45d7505a1a1a3.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players across PC and mobile devices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b47c2975fd0573786691165f2fb08357.poster.avif?t=1755616281\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b47c2975fd0573786691165f2fb08357.webm?t=1755616281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains. Each domino has two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tiles so that at least one side connects to a matching terrain type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3029180?t=1755616281","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/34ee8f4bc1ea9df60a27191df37e2a5ac368ab24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755616281","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/bda1e70eaafd8baf5c74ea53da86da9817305901/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755616281","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/bda1e70eaafd8baf5c74ea53da86da9817305901/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755616281","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Reviews</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meeple Mountain - \u201cKingdomino is a delightful take on dominoes with some very clever additions.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wargamer - \u201cWith breezy gameplay, simple but impactful decisions, a short run-time, and the undeniable pleasure of building a kingdom from beautiful tiles, Kingdomino is a rare treat.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board Game Review UK - \u201cA joy to play for a quick family-friendly puzzle.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres (Game of the Year) board game award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/e28b3f486006a6edf3265cb1002eabd4.poster.avif?t=1755616281\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/e28b3f486006a6edf3265cb1002eabd4.webm?t=1755616281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/94fb3f4b04e4f1132b8547fc681f56d1.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the genuine Kingdomino board game by Bruno Cathala and Blue Orange with all original rules and artwork from Cyril Bouquet and Pauline D\u00e9traz.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/873d561d7b61a1b9f410c11865c76030.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge AI opponents, join online multiplayer matches, or play online with friends. Take on the illustrious 7x7 Mighty Duel challenge, or stack up your score with over 15 unique quests to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/07b60893751d148b51127720daf403ab.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span>Uncover and explore uncharted lands. Earn unique rewards by gathering domino pieces and crafting them into Magic Dominoes in the single-player Lost Kingdom mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/a44c1b1f9b4bf1c0781c68b3ca1e7140.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together as a community by competing in Live Events and Challenges! Complete special daily quests to gain points. If the community earns enough points by the time the event ends, exclusive rewards can be won!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/13409a26899d4268ecfa2ef44451b543.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-crafted visuals with dynamic animations bring your kingdom to life. Play the game based on the new Kingdomino 2025 visuals by Pauline D\u00e9traz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/0a8a55fa04a5ce7cd5d45d7505a1a1a3.avif?t=1755616281\" width=614 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with other players across PC and mobile devices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b47c2975fd0573786691165f2fb08357.poster.avif?t=1755616281\" width=800 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b47c2975fd0573786691165f2fb08357.webm?t=1755616281\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains. Each domino has two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tiles so that at least one side connects to a matching terrain type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p>","developers":["Meeple Corp"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/a0c94dbd46303c0e3fd701045a0ba8a59d3ef123/header.jpg?t=1755616281","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Blue Orange Edition. Kingdomino and Blue Orange are trademarks of Blue Orange Edition, France. Game published and distributed under license by Blue Orange, 97 impasse Jean Lamour, 54700 Pont-\u00e0-Mousson, France.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or above<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257111964,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111964/movie480.mp4?t=1752590487","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111964/movie_max.mp4?t=1752590487"},"name":"Kingdomino Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257111964/096107c91e414ec498ce75c61af548be21c78487/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752590487","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111964/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1752590487","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257111964/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1752590487"}}],"name":"Kingdomino","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64bit version only)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 or AMD Ryzen 3 2200G<br></li><li><